## Multi-Agent Roles

### Agent 1: Researcher
- Reads from: external sources, docs, APIs
- Writes to: research/ directory
- Never modifies: src/, tests/
- Signal file: research/DONE.md (create when finished)

### Agent 2: Builder
- Reads from: research/, src/
- Writes to: src/, config/
- Never modifies: tests/, research/
- Signal file: src/BUILD_COMPLETE.md

### Agent 3: Reviewer
- Reads from: src/, tests/
- Writes to: tests/, reviews/
- Never modifies: src/ (only flags issues)
- Signal file: reviews/REVIEW_COMPLETE.md
